{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Candy Crawler, you play as Crispin Crumble, a small-town baker with a big secret. Hidden beneath his shop there are portals that lead to mysterious candy realms. Realms filled with exotic sweets and lurking threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running a bakery isn\u2019t easy, especially with a greedy, micromanaging landlord breathing down your neck. Every week, they make up new fees and increase the rent, forcing Crispin to work harder just to keep his business afloat. Don\u2019t miss too many payments, or you could lose everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore the candy-themed dungeons, fight candy foes, and collect exotic ingredients for your bakery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/dungeon-gameplay-comp.gif?t=1741319653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft mouthwatering desserts, stock your displays, and serve customers to keep your shop running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/cooking-gameplay-01.gif?t=1741319653\" />\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your kitchen, attract more customers, and boost productivity to stay ahead of the ever-increasing rent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/upgrade-shop.gif?t=1741319653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race Against Time \u2013 With limited daily actions, you must balance exploration, baking, and shopkeeping before the next rent deadline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/debt-repayment.gif?t=1741319653\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2996900?t=1741319653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2996900?t=1741319653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/e1514486379f435e83a76922afe0783519d572ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741319653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/e1514486379f435e83a76922afe0783519d572ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741319653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Candy Crawler, you play as Crispin Crumble, a small-town baker with a big secret. Hidden beneath his shop there are portals that lead to mysterious candy realms. Realms filled with exotic sweets and lurking threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running a bakery isn\u2019t easy, especially with a greedy, micromanaging landlord breathing down your neck. Every week, they make up new fees and increase the rent, forcing Crispin to work harder just to keep his business afloat. Don\u2019t miss too many payments, or you could lose everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore the candy-themed dungeons, fight candy foes, and collect exotic ingredients for your bakery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class